WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.850
A club’s results sheet has a last line.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.560
The member named on it finished behind everyone else.

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:10.630
A new doctoral thesis asks what clubs do about that line,

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.970
and whether it changes who comes back.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.520
For seven years I compiled the weekly results of a cross-country league.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.460
I was regularly asked to leave a name off the bottom of the sheet,

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:22.760
and sometimes did.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.550
Of a hundred and sixty-four club series,

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:29.110
a hundred and forty-one had a remedy for last place:

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:32.790
a list that stops short, a handicap, a wooden spoon,

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:36.540
or an appointed last, rostered to finish behind everyone.

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.560
At weekly timed runs, the appointed last is the tail walker.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:42.718
On some Saturdays, nobody takes the role.

00:00:43.468 --> 00:00:44.458
With no tail walker,

00:00:44.658 --> 00:00:49.328
forty-four point seven per cent of the slowest participants came back within eight weeks.

00:00:49.628 --> 00:00:52.378
With one, sixty-one point three per cent did.

00:00:53.128 --> 00:00:55.124
An appointed last told him:

00:00:55.325 --> 00:00:58.025
My job is the bottom line of the sheet.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.734
I’m not there to help anyone round.

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:02.224
I’m there so the last name on it is mine.

00:01:02.974 --> 00:01:05.111
In a trial across eighteen club series,

00:01:05.311 --> 00:01:09.711
fifty-eight point two per cent of the members who came last returned for the next round.

00:01:10.011 --> 00:01:14.241
With an appointed last behind them, seventy-three point one per cent did.

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:17.621
A ranked list always has a bottom row, he argues.

00:01:17.921 --> 00:01:19.791
It can be reassigned, but not removed.

00:01:20.541 --> 00:01:22.771
Under the School’s new Last Place Roster,

00:01:22.971 --> 00:01:26.551
every ranked list it publishes will carry a member of staff,

00:01:26.751 --> 00:01:30.861
one place below the last genuine entrant, with nothing written beside it.
